{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/qGb6qLUmQMWwIvdNPXZ3rA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:42.422455+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/qGb6qLUmQMWwIvdNPXZ3rA","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>一、学院及学科简介</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span>东华大学纺织学院始于1951年，是东华大学办学历史最久、学科实力最强的学院，也是我国首批获得学士、硕士和博士三级学位授予权的学院。以纺织学院作为主要载体的纺织科学与工程学科是国家一流学科和A+学科，在教育部历轮学科评估中均稳居同类学科全国第一（A+），2023—2025年蝉联软科世界一流学科排名第一。纺织学院先后获批国家级实验教学示范中心、荣获全国教育系统先进集体、教育部立德树人机制综合改革试点院系、国家级教学团队、国家级高层次人才、全国高校黄大年式教师团队等。学院为新中国纺织工业培养了众多优秀人才和行业领袖，并取得一大批高水平成果，为我国纺织工业的现代化做出了重要贡献。</span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/UmqIGPRrY3QUqibM0zQISaiaCwJ16PicH4Aj39FD9YricsQd7awK9wzsU1ONepaOQPAWiaDkKof6uwibqdH88lY3D8koA0LqIFkxZPAzQVMBtkCKY/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span>纺织学院发展愿景是全面建成纺织世界一流学科。学院设置纺织工程、非织造材料与工程、功能材料3个国家一流本科专业；拥有纺织工程、纺织材料与纺织品设计和非织造材料与工程3个博士、硕士学位点，先进纺织制造技术、纺织生物材料与技术等11个研究方向；材料与化工、机械、能源动力3个工程博士学位点，材料与化工1个专业硕士学位点；目前学科方向主要包括四大建设方向：纺织材料与前沿交叉、纺织成型与绿色制造、纺织设计与健康时尚、智能纺织与 AI 赋能，并前瞻布局六大未来产业和三大交叉中心。拥有纺织面料技术教育部重点实验室、产业用纺织品教育部工程研究中心和国家认证认可监督管理委员会计量认证的东华大学纺织检测中心等科研基地。</span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/UmqIGPRrY3RhDaMmpGP94LL4RBlh1UJNd6jnZWfqlGTAWLduN86bSoKvicpPiaRvr8oq9y3qaSHRoz46VKMEJ17MOuuRNBAN1OO7k5ovUfTRI/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/UmqIGPRrY3TKk7NJLf9IbKyK5Og82DoyJzVA4UVSTYJpsxZgun2vyOQN4e8n2M6swLoHefiazibrXurAGjsUoRC4jJ1ZWb16rB4beHglBTicfI/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/UmqIGPRrY3SPaHEJwh1pH9X8ojibbHKjNCUC9xElQ27PBdZVUGwicicRx7AXYrHmRqJlQsVqBLH1X1ic3Y8qLgaAa2QIribXUDSeibmQtr3ib3dZqs/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/UmqIGPRrY3TkqR4KxAzQrDZV5wibH7jZkhSa3vOLTOcib0vFEwQBvFAE0VLlMSZJrDJ4mqCOKHu5DyMuLnO06T18wOJ143l3VRqVdCQrJ7qq8/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>二、申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>·品学兼优。</span></p><p><span>·预计能够取得本科就读高校的推荐免试资格。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>三、推免生优惠政策</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>·可跨专业报考。</span></p><p><span>·可优先申请硕博连读或长学制，转为博士学籍后，可获得2万元博士新生奖学金。</span></p><p><span>·同等条件下可优先录取“拔尖创新人才计划”，入选者最多可获2万元专项经费支持。</span></p><p><span>·东华大学“纺织科学与工程”学科是国家“双一流”建设学科，推免生硕士毕业时符合当年上海市落户基本条件即可申请获得沪籍。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>四、接收专业</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><table><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><p><span>（一）学术型硕士专业</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><section><span>专业代码</span></section></td><td><section><span>专业名称</span></section></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>082101</span></p></td><td><p><span>纺织工程</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>082102 </span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>纺织材料与纺织品设计</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>0821Z5  </span></p></td><td><p><span>非织造材料与工程</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><table><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><p><span>（二）专业型硕士专业</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><section><span>专业代码</span></section></td><td><section><span>专业名称</span></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><span>085600</span></section></td><td><section><span>材料与化工</span></section></td></tr></tbody></table><table><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><p><span>（三）直博生专业</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><section><span>专业代码</span></section></td><td><section><span>专业名称</span></section></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>082101</span></p></td><td><section><span>纺织工程</span></section></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>082102</span></p></td><td><section><span>纺织材料与纺织品设计</span></section></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>0821Z5 </span></p></td><td><section><span>非织造材料与工程</span></section></td></tr></tbody></table></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>五、申请流程与时间</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1. 预报名截止时间</span></p><p><span>2026年9月22日。</span></p><p><span>2. 申请通道</span></p><p><span>通过“东华大学研招网”推免</span><span><span>生预</span></span><span>申请系统进行申报，具体要求详见东华大学研究生招生网相关公告。</span></p><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzY5ODI2NDk0NQ==&amp;mid=2247497230&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=61c661977de53ef902d6372869600f3c&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">点击查看相关通知</a></span></p><p><span>3. 审核与复试</span></p><p><span>学院将定期集中审核申请，确定复试名单并分批组织复试。复试时间预计集中在9月，具体安排请关注东华大学研招网及学院网站。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>六、联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>联系人： 张老师</span></p><p><span>电话：021-67798718；邮箱：fzyjs@dhu.edu.cn</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/UmqIGPRrY3RHRVnhJ1PDrIfDyzvsmIydE5r4abuVa1bgAg28ymAEMIu2BZI73vdETq2AtzyLzv3pSG1fcmIN6kmQhSxLYiaqguhdoY3kG6WM/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>排版：陈赞美</span></p><p><span>责编：郭珊珊</span></p><p><span>聚焦东华大学特色专业、一流学科</span></p><p><span>— —纺织科学与工程的人和事</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"3c6bdcb0d61788cefd9673c3696dd18b8bbe2c295b5992635f4d4dea1c46fa05","textLength":1173,"sourceSha256":"f0551d96725a0a96fc9a3c6b3eae174a3e0a5570fef0f1e881c85962fed352a6","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-2066d27a0428e9e8d9e5","title":"2026年东华大学纺织学院2027年接收推荐免试研究生（含直博生）预报名公告","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:42.422455+00:00"}
